sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client/GitLab
  participant A as API (no device route)
  participant Q as Queue
  participant W as Protected worker
  participant S as Secret service
  participant D as Device
  C->>A: Submit approved job
  A->>Q: Validate and enqueue
  Q->>W: Deliver job
  W->>S: Request scoped credential
  W->>D: Verify target and operate
  D-->>W: Result
  W-->>Q: Evidence and final status
